# Static headers for what the platform serves from the assets: the built pages and files.
# `bun run assemble` merges this file after the frontend's own `_headers` (its lines come first) and
# adds the one Content-Security-Policy line of the build, which carries hashes and so can never
# live here. The Worker's response is never covered by this file: server/middleware/handler.ts
# sets its headers. Limits: 100 rules, 2,000 characters per line.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
